msgid "AI Connectors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/strings.php:92
msgid "Disable AI provider connectors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/strings.php:93
msgid "Turns off WordPress 7.0 AI provider connectors via the <code>wp_supports_ai</code> gate and closes the core Connectors screen. Other plugins that read the same gate, Jetpack among them, switch their own AI features off as well. Also fires <code>keel_disable_ai_connectors</code> for AI integrations core does not know about."
